      <div class="ak-section-heading ak-style-1">
        <h2 class="ak-section-title">Your Questions, Answered</h2>
        <p>Find answers to the most common questions about business registration, legal compliance, and our services. This page is optimized for voice search and AI assistants to help you find the information you need quickly.</p>
